blob: 52e57e95c83b9d02fb4e3d1a737cbae89598a3a4
decision: pass
reviewer: claude-opus-5-5 (self-review)
audience: Technical leads and maintainers
purpose: Who decides which native command runs when it differs by operating system?

Records the decision that platform-specific variants of commands.verify and documentation.generated[].command are declared by the project with -macos/-linux/-windows suffixes, selected via uname -s.
Translated from Korean to English as a frozen record; the required default declaration, the rejected nested-mapping and portable-command alternatives, and the ADR 0014/0019 links are preserved.
Headings mapped to Decision / Context and constraints / Rationale and alternatives / Consequences.
Output example, paths, error text and test path kept verbatim; no Korean literals retained.

